          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Modeled after our best-selling MoonShade original, now reworked for RV setups with Keder rails. With dual Keder welts on both 9ft and 7ft sides, you get more ways to mount and more flexibility in your layout. <br/><br/>The 420D ripstop polyester canopy is seam-sealed with a water-resistant connection method to stop water from sneaking in through. Plus, the reflective underside bounces back lantern light at night for a brighter, more ambient space.</p>",
